{{Quote|Wesa give yousa una bongo. Da speedest way tooda Naboo tis goen through de planet core. Now go.|Boss [[Rugor Nass|Nass]]|<ref name="TPM">{{Film|I}}</ref>}}
The '''Naboo Abyss''' was a series of submerged, cavernous tunnels that ran throughout the [[planet]] [[Naboo]], reaching the surface and passing through the world's core. A variety of creatures lived throughout the tunnels including the [[opee sea killer]], [[colo claw fish]], [[yobshrimp]] and [[sando aqua monster]].<ref name="AEYNTK">''[[Star Wars: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know]]''</ref> The [[Jedi Master]] [[Qui-Gon Jinn]], his [[padawan]] [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] and the [[Gungan]] [[Jar Jar Binks]] traveled through the Abyss in a [[Tribubble bongo|Gungan bongo submarine]] when attempting to reach the [[city]] of [[Theed]] from the aquatic city of [[Otoh Gunga]].<ref name="TPM" />

